The Subscription
 object on the request body is the TPP's webhook configuration. It is consumed by the Hub for event delivery — the LFI MUST NOT act on it. The LFI's only obligation is to emit status events via PATCH /insurance-quote-log/{logId}
; the Hub fans those out to any subscribed TPP webhook.

The Subscription
 object is the TPP's webhook registration for the Hub's event delivery. The Hub stores it; the LFI MUST NOT act on it. Your only obligation is to emit status events through PATCH /insurance-quote-log/{logId}
 and the Hub fans them out.
